_meta charset="utf-8"
_meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"
_title
  yr — the language that both people and AI can understand
_meta name="description" content="yr keeps a whole web project in one file, split by simple markers. AI reads it in one go, edits only the section you asked for, and you can still read every line."
_meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f2ec"
_link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"
